knowledge-is-a-lack-of-ignorance-19 : Part
knowledge-is-a-lack-of-ignorance-19 = referring (cons "Each division was a cut that someone made primary. In the design, none is: every one of them can still be drawn as an analysis, and what each can see is bounded by a proof." nil) (cons "Each division between fields of knowledge that the primitive of hyperactivity removes was a cut that someone made primary. In the design of hyperactivity, none is primary: every one of them can still be drawn as an analysis, and what each can see is bounded by a proof." nil)
